----- CHANGELOG ------

Added a 'Screens' category where you can choose which screens Spatial GUI affects
Fixed compatibility issues with shaders, EMI, Inventory Interactions, and high resolution displays (with help from Dizabanik)
Added a curved first person screen option (thanks to Vibing)
Added a config to interpolate the x rotation when opening the third person GUI
Added a keybind in Minecraft's controls to open the Spatial GUI config, to help tune your settings (unbound by default)
Several other bugs were fixed along the way